@startuml mado-volume1-eu1-cross-border-exchange
    title EU-1 Locate and Access a Patient Study from an Imaging Manifest

    participant "Document Consumer (Imaging Manifest)" as Consumer
    participant "Document Access Provider (Imaging Manifest)" as DocProvider
    participant "Imaging Document Source" as Wado

    == Locate and select manifest ==
    note over Consumer: Use patient identifier and anatomical region
    Consumer -> DocProvider ++: Search manifests by patient identifier and anatomical region [ITI-67]
    DocProvider --> Consumer --: Matching manifest metadata and references
    Consumer -> Consumer: Select a manifest from the search results
    Consumer -> DocProvider ++: Retrieve selected manifest [ITI-68]
    DocProvider --> Consumer --: Manifest document

    == Access study content ==
    Consumer -> Consumer: Read study, series, and instance references
    Consumer -> Wado ++: WADO-RS retrieval for content represented by the manifest [RAD-160]/[RAD-107]
    Wado --> Consumer --: DICOM instances/series payload
    Consumer -> Consumer: Render or process the study

@enduml